[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2608.26803, 'On bubbling of Fueter maps'] For $(f, \bx, H) \in \cN^m_n$, the operator  
    \begin{equation*}
      \cD: T_{(f, \bx)} \cI_n \to \cE_{f}': \quad D(\xi, \eta) = \cD_{f, H} \xi
    \end{equation*}
  is Fredholm of index $-n$.

