[Theorem exact_V of arXiv:2411.04322, 'Bounding Hellinger Distance with Stein's Method'] Under the assumptions of (ustattheorem of the paper),  fix  
any $D\in(0,\sqrt{n})$ and define
$\kappa\triangleq \frac{R^2}{D\sqrt{n}}$ and 
$B_{n} 
    \triangleq  (\frac{8}{n-1}+\frac{16+2\sqrt{2}}{\sqrt{n-1}})\|u(X_1,X_2)\|_4^2$.
Then
\begin{talign}  
\sqrt{2}&  H(U_n,Z)
    \le 

\beta + 

\beta_{0}
\quad\text{for}\quad
    \\
\beta
    &\triangleq
\frac{3R^4\alpha  e^{2\kappa}}{\sqrt{n}}(\frac{\sqrt{1-\frac{D}{\sqrt{n}}}}{D}
    +
\frac{\log(\frac{4\sqrt{n}}{D})}{2\sqrt{n}})
    +
\frac{6\alpha R^3 e^{2\kappa}}{(n\kappa)^{3/4}\sqrt{D}\sqrt{n-1}}
    +
\frac{2\sqrt{3}\alpha R^3e^{2\kappa}}{n^{3/4}\sqrt{D}}
    +
\frac{{B_{n}}\log(\frac{n}{D^2})}{2\sqrt{2}}
    \quad\text{and}\quad\\%\lessapprox\frac{(4\sqrt{2}+1)\|u(X_1,X_2)\|_4^2\log(\frac{n}{D^2})}{\sqrt{n}},\\
\beta_{0} 
    &\triangleq
-\frac{1}{2}\log(1-\frac{D}{\sqrt{n}})(1+\|\score[U_n](U_n)U_n\|_2)
   +\frac{D}{\sqrt{n}-D}\|I_{U_n}(U_n)\|_2+\frac{1}{3}(\frac{D}{\sqrt{n}-D})^{3/2}\|\score[U_n](U_n)\|_2. 

\end{talign}

[Definition eq: loops to be inserted in STEP2 of arXiv:2411.16398, 'Large Deviations of Cover Time of Tori in Dimensions $d\geq 3$'] For each $\omega \in \mathcal{A}$ and $\boldsymbol{x}\in \mathcal{R}(\mathcal{L}_{\boldsymbol{F}}^{\beta_N}(\omega))$, we define the collection of loops to be inserted in the second step as follows:
    \begin{equation}

        B^{\Tree}(\omega)=\big\{\beta^{\Tree}(\mathsf{C}_{\boldsymbol{x}},\boldsymbol{x})\,:\,\boldsymbol{x} \in \mathcal{R}(\mathcal{L}_{\boldsymbol{F}}^{\beta_N}(\omega)) \big\}.
