[Lem X^p-1b1 of arXiv:2411.01849, 'A tamed-adaptive Milstein scheme for stochastic differential equations with low regularity'] For any $p>0$, there exists a positive constant $C_p$, which does not depend on $\Delta$, such that for any $s>0$, it holds that 
