[Lemma 20 of arXiv:2510.20492, 'Heterochromatic two-arm probabilities for metric graph Gaussian free fields'] For any $d\ge 3$, $v\in \widetilde{\mathbb{Z}}^d$ and $N\ge 1$, 
	\begin{equation}
		\mathbf{e}_{v,v}\big(\big\{\widetilde{\eta}: \mathrm{ran}(\widetilde{\eta})\cap \partial B(N)\neq \emptyset \big\} \big)\lesssim N^{2-d}. 
	\end{equation}

