[Cor Kor: Diag.matrix, char. Poly. superkrit. Reg. of arXiv:2509.15790, 'Covariance matrices of volume power functionals of random simplicial complexes -- an asymp'] Assuming the situation of Theorem (Thm: EW.e, ER.e superkrit. Reg. of the paper) set  $D=\text{diag}(\lambda_1,\dots,\lambda_1,\lambda_2)\in \mathbb{R}^{n \times n}$
