[Proposition 56 of arXiv:2511.09517, 'From Cannings model to Brownian motion conditioned on local time profile'] Assume \eqref{H1}--\eqref{H2}. Then:
\begin{enumerate}[label=(\arabic*), ref=\arabic*]
