[Lem 22 of arXiv:2605.27974, 'Discrete approximation of semi-Dirichlet forms with non-symmetric perturbations of resista'] Let $\{ f^{(n)}\}_{n \in \N}\subset C(X)$ and $f\in C(X)$. If $\limtoinfty{n}\norm{f^{(n)}-f}_{\infty}=0$,
