\|I_1(\phi)\|_p \leq \mathcal{B}_p (\|\phi\|_{\mathcal{H}}+\|\phi\|_{L^p({\bf Z})}),
\end{equation}
where $\mathcal{B}_p$ is the constant from Theorem (rosenthal of the paper).

