        S f(x',x_n):=\int K(x,y') f(y',x_n)\: dy', \quad T_{\xi,\delta}:= \left( \Psi_{\xi,\delta} \right)_* S \Psi_{\xi,\delta}^{*}.
    \end{equation}
    Then \(T_{\xi,\delta}:\HsWSpace{\kappa}[\ManifoldNZero][\C^M]\rightarrow \HsWSpace{\kappa}[\Omega][\C^M]\) and is continuous.

