$\sigma_2(\kappa)=1$, and $H\geq2$. Then, for every $i$,
\begin{equation}
 \Theta_i\geq-\frac{n-4}{n}.
\end{equation}
Moreover,
\begin{equation}
 |\kappa_i|\leq\frac H8
 \quad\Longrightarrow\quad
 \Theta_i\geq\frac{1}{2}.
\end{equation}

