[Thm dle of arXiv:2411.14090, '{\bf Exponential Ergodicity in $\W_1$ for SDEs with Distribution Dependent Noise and Parti'] Assume {\bf(A2)} for
$$L_b^2\gamma^{-2}<\frac{3}{4}K_1.$$
