[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2608.27307, '2608.27307'] Under Assumption~\ref{ass:basic}, for every $z=E+\ii\eta\in\C^+$, the solution $\Pi(z)$ satisfies
        \begin{align}
                \Im\Pi_{11} & =\Im m\Pi_{11}^*\Sg\Pi_{11}+(\eta+\Im g)\Pi_{21}^*\Pi_{21},  \\
                \Im\Pi_{22} & =\Im m\Pi_{12}^*\Sg\Pi_{12}+(\eta+\Im g)\Pi_{22}^*\Pi_{22}. 
        \end{align}
        Consequently,
        \begin{align}
                \Im g & =\Im m\avg{\Pi_{11}^*\Sg\Pi_{11}\Sg}_N+(\eta+\Im g)\avg{\Pi_{21}\Sg\Pi_{21}^*}_N,  \\
                \Im m & =\Im m\avg{\Pi_{12}^*\Sg\Pi_{12}}_N+(\eta+\Im g)\avg{\Pi_{22}^*\Pi_{22}}_N. 
        \end{align}

