[Proposition 19 of arXiv:2607.29534, 'Expected signatures via partial integration, coordinate change and symmetrization'] Whenever well-defined, we have  \begin{equation}
        \langle w,\bmu_{s,t}\rangle_\Psi =\int_{\Delta^k_{s,t}} \mathcal{C}^w_{s,t}(t_1,\dots,t_k) \dd A^{\blue{i_1}}_{t_1}\cdots \dd A^{\blue{i_k}}_{t_k} \quad \text{and} \quad \langle [w],\wh \bmu_{s,t}\rangle_\Psi =\int_{\Delta^k_{s,t}} \wh{\mathcal{C}}^{[w]}_{s,t}(t_1,\dots,t_k) \dd A^{\blue{i_1}}_{t_1}\cdots \dd A^{\blue{i_k}}_{t_k}
