[Proposition MMU2 of arXiv:2606.24304, 'Quantitative Homogenization of PDEs with Neumann boundary conditions: a probabilistic appr'] For any $h>0$ and $s \in[t, T-h]$, and { any } $\lambda \geqslant 1$, 
