[Proposition 11 of arXiv:2606.23383, 'Near-Lipschitz stability of the Kim--Milman flow map'] For any $\mu,\nu$ satisfying~\eqref{theta}, assuming that $\mom(\mu),\mom(\nu)\leq M$,
\begin{align*}
    - \int_\eps^\delta \frac{\dd}{\dd t}\, \|\KM^\mu_{t\gets} - \KM^\nu_{t\gets}\|_{L^2(\gamma)} \dd t
    &\le 2M\,(1-e^{-\delta}) + 2\sqrt{d\,(1-e^{-2\delta})}\,.
\end{align*}

