[Thm 86 (Three-entropy formula) of arXiv:2507.08909, 'Annealed almost periodic entropy'] If~\eqref{eq:traces-fast} holds and $\phi \in \B(\A,\rmM_k)_+$, then
	\begin{equation} 
\rmh_{\bspi}^\ann(\phi) = \rmh_{\bspi}^0(\phi) + \log \Delta \phi_{\rm{ac}}
\end{equation}
and
\begin{equation}
\ul{\rmh}^\ann_{\bspi}(\phi) = \ul{\rmh}_{\bspi}^0(\phi) + \log \Delta \phi_{\rm{ac}} .
\end{equation}

