If the covariance function $\xi$ from (equation cov_c of the paper) is convex on $[0,1]^\mathscr{S}$, then for either ${\scaleobj{1.1}{\diamond}}\in\{\mathsf{Ising},\mathsf{spherical}\}$ we have
\eeq{ 
\lim_{N\to\infty} F_{N,{\scaleobj{1.1}{\diamond}}}(\vc\Delta,\vc\lambda_N)=\lim_{N\to\infty} F_{N,{\scaleobj{1.1}{\diamond}}}^\mathsf{single}(\boldsymbol{\beta}),
}
