		We then obtain
		\begin{align*}ol_for_couple_of_vertices}
			e^{-\Vol_d(\Ball\cup\Ball')} \1_{(c,c')\in(\VOM)^2_{\neq}(\lbrace0\rbrace\cup\lbrace\x,\y,\y'\rbrace)} 
