[Corollary 15 of arXiv:2606.12720, 'On McDiarmid's Inequality under Dependence \\ via Approximate Tensorization of Entropy'] {Covariance Bound for Tilts of Strongly Log-Concave Measures}


    Let $\nu$ on $\R^n$ be $\alpha$-strongly log-concave. Then, for all $v \in \R^n$ the $\mathcal T_v \nu(x) \propto \exp(v\T x) d\nu(x)$ fulfill
    \begin{align*}
        \cov[\mathcal T_v \nu]{X} 
        \preceq 1/\alpha \cdot I_n. 
    \end{align*}

