[Lemma boundary-values2 of arXiv:2504.18739, 'discrete analogues of second-order Riesz transforms'] For all $n\in\mathbb{Z}^d$ and $T>0$,  
\begin{align*}
    \mathbb{P}_{(0, T)}(Z_T=(n,0))
    =\lim_{t\to T, \delta\to 0}\mathbb{P}_{(0, T)}(|X_t-n|<\delta)
    =\frac{P_T(n)}{H_T(0)}.
\end{align*}

