[Lemma L:2F1-Log of arXiv:2602.05317, 'Strong local nondeterminism for stochastic time-fractional\\ slow and fast diffusion equat'] For all $H \in (1/2, 1)$ and $t > 0$, the following holds:
    \begin{align*}
      \int_0^t (t-s)^{2H-2} \log\left(\frac{t+s}{t-s}\right) \ensuremath{\mathrm{d} } s =
    t^{2H-1} \left(\frac{\Gamma(2H-1)}{\Gamma(1+2H)} \lMr{2}{F}{1}(1,1;1+2H;-1) + \frac{1}{(2H-1)^2}\right).
  \end{align*}

