[Lemma lem:6 of arXiv:2410.23250, 'Strict inequalities for arm exponents in planar percolation'] For all $k\ge 1$ and $\delta>0$ satisfying $k\ge 1/\delta$, we have
  \begin{equation}
        \mathbb P[\mathcal B_k^\delta]\lesssim \delta^{1/3}. 
  \end{equation}

