[Proposition eigenvalue_cond of arXiv:2606.16609, 'On stability of outliers from the circular law'] Let $\lambda \notin \mathrm{Sp}(D_N)$, then 
    \begin{equation}
        \lambda \in \mathrm{Sp}(G(t)) \iff F(\lambda):= \lambda - (a_N+t)- b_N^*\mathbf{R}_{N}(\lambda)c_N=0
    \end{equation}
    where $\mathbf{R}_N(\lambda):=(\lambda-D_N)^{-1}$
    and the overlap associated to an eigenvalue $\lambda_1$ is 
    \begin{equation*}
        \mathscr{O}_11= \frac{(1+c_N^*\mathbf{R}_{N}(\lambda_1)^*\mathbf{R}_{N}(\lambda_1)c_N)(1+b_N^*\mathbf{R}_{N}(\lambda_1)\mathbf{R}_{N}(\lambda_1)^*b_N)}{\lvert 1 +b_N^*\mathbf{R}_{N}(\lambda_1)^2c_N\lvert^2}.
    \end{equation*}

