[Lem l:estXn of arXiv:2504.07255, 'A Tail-Respecting Splitting Numerical Scheme\\ for L\'evy-Driven SDEs With Superlinear Dri'] For any $r\in(0,\infty)$, any $T\in[0,\infty)$, any $N\in\mathbb{N}_0$ and all $k=0,\dots,N$ the following estimate holds:
\begin{equation}\begin{aligned}

\sup_{t\in[t_k,t_{k+1})}
\mathbf{E}^{(N)}_{t_1,\dots,t_N} \Big[\|X_t^n\|^r \Big|\mathscr{F}_{t_k}\Big] \leq_C 1+\|X_{t_k}^n\|^r
\end{aligned}\end{equation}
uniformly over $n\in\mathbb{N}$.

