[Lemma of arXiv:2506.21466, 'The Markov property for $\varphi^4_3$ on the cylinder'] For every $\kappa > 0$ sufficiently small, there exists $C>0$ such that for every $T>0$ and $\varphi_-,\varphi_+ \in \mathcal C^{-1/2-\kappa}_z$, 
\begin{equation}
