Then for every $f \in \bb H^{\epsilon}(\R^d \setminus [\mathsf{blocks}])$ and every $\bb \xi \in \{\bb \xi^* \pm \delta \bb e_1, \bb \xi^* \pm \delta \bb e_2\}$, it holds that
