			&= \int_0^\infty te^{-\lambda t} \mathbb{E}_\rho \left[\left(\overline{P}_{t/2} (\overline{\eta}(0)\overline{\eta}(1))\right)^2 \right]\, {\mathrm{d}} t  \leqslant C \lambda^{-1}.
