\ell_E^*(z)
=
\prod_{k=1}^{\infty} \psi_k^V(z)
-
\ell_E^*(0)
\sum_{n=1}^{\infty}
\big( 1 - \psi_n^H(z) \big) \prod_{k=1}^n \psi_k^V(z),

