[Proposition approximate tensorization of entropy over components of arXiv:2511.05223, 'Kac's Program and Relative Entropy Decay for Nonlinear Spin-Exchange Dynamics'] Under the assumptions of Theorem (MLSI DOWN UP MC of the paper), for all $F:\Omega_{L,\ensuremath{\mathcal M}} \to {\ensuremath{\mathbb R}} _+$, 
\begin{equation}
\sum_{B \in \mathcal{B}} \nu_{L,\ensuremath{\mathcal M}}\left[\operatorname{Ent}_{\nu_B}(F)\right]\ge (1 - 2\lambda(\Lambda))\, \mathrm{Ent}_{\nu_{L,\ensuremath{\mathcal M}}}(F) \,.
