[Lem 16 of arXiv:2609.03418, 'Sampling and Density Theorems for the Fractional Opdam--Cherednik Transform'] Let $S=[-\Omega,\Omega]$, $I=[-R,R]$, and put
$W=R\csc\theta$. Then
\begin{align}
\operatorname{Tr}(\mathbf{L}_{I,S}^\theta)& = \frac{2^{1-2\rho}}{\pi} \Omega R \csc \theta + \operatorname{o}(R),\quad R\to \infty
\end{align}

