and,
    \begin{equation}
      -\int_{\domO} \psi^{\prime \prime}(\phi(x))\lvert \nabla \phi(x) \rvert^2\,\d x 
       \leq  \lvert \nabla \phi \rvert_{\mathbb{L}^2}^2, \;\; \phi \in H^1(\domO) \cap L^\infty(\domO).
    \end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

