[Proposition 15 of arXiv:2607.22438, 'A deterministic scalar reduction for the phase transition in two interacting urns'] The map $\alpha\mapsto p_\alpha$ is not nondecreasing. More precisely,
\begin{equation}
 p_{5/2}>\frac{31}{100}>p_3.
\end{equation}

