[Lem trace power bfM-n-R asymp of arXiv:2608.23156, 'Disc counting statistics of the real Ginibre ensemble'] Under the assumptions of Lemma~(lem: trace power bfL-n-R asymp of the paper), we have as $N = 2n\to\infty$ that
    \begin{equation} 
        \operatorname{Tr} [\mathbf{M}_N(R)^m] = (r \wedge 1) \sqrt{\frac{n}{\pi m}} + o(\sqrt{n}). 
    \end{equation}

