body:
[Lemma lem: bound on E r for r at least 2 of arXiv:2605.28770, 'Cutoff profiles for conjugacy invariant random walks on symmetric groups'] Let $n\geq 2$. For any $t\geq 0$, we have
    \begin{equation}
        \sum_{r\geq 2} E_r^{(n)}(t) \leq \left( \sum_{r=2}^{\left\lfloor (n-1)/2\right\rfloor} n^r \left( 1 - \frac{2r(n-r+1)}{n(n-1)}\right)^{t} \right) + \frac{\sqrt{p(n)n!}}{2^{t+1}}.
    \end{equation}

