[Theorem k1k1LIIinftythm of arXiv:2608.04730, 'A new look at some aspects of one-dimensional random sequential adsorption and its continu'] Let $m_{k_1,k_2;II}$ be as in Theorem (k1k2IIthm of the paper). Then for $L\in (1,2]$,
\begin{equation}
