body:
[Corollary cor:bernstein_density of arXiv:2609.01581, 'Concentration of additive functionals of Stratonovich-type'] Under the assumptions of Theorem~(thm:explicit_density of the paper), for all $t>0$ and
$a>0$, the following simpler bound holds
\begin{align}
  \mathbb{P}^\nu\left(\overline{\rho}_t(V) - \E^\mu[\overline{\rho}_t] \geq a\right)
  \leq
  \left\|\frac{\mathrm{d}\nu}{\mathrm{d}\mu}\right\|_{L^2(\mu)}
  \exp\left(-\frac{ta^2}{2\bigl(\tilde\sigma_\rho^2 + c_\rho a\bigr)}\right).

\end{align}

