[Lemma 63 of arXiv:2509.01797, 'Relation between Wick powers and excursion clusters of the 2D GFF'] On the event $\mathbf{E}$, 
for every $n\geq 1$,
\begin{displaymath}
f_{0}\hat{\psi}_{n}
=
\sum_{0\leq k\leq \lfloor n/2\rfloor}
(-1)^{k} \dfrac{n!}{2^{k} k! (n-2k)!} V_{D,\widehat{D}}^{k}f_{0}\psi_{n-2k}.
\end{displaymath}

