body:
[Proposition 10 of arXiv:2607.07283, 'Multi-time Markov renewal chains and stratified renewal theorems'] For non-negative kernel sequences $A$ and $B$,

\begin{equation*}
\Pi_{D_0}(A*B)=(\Pi_{D_0}A)*(\Pi_{D_0}B).
\end{equation*}

Consequently, if $\psi$ is the potential of $q$, then $\Pi_{D_0}\psi$ is the potential of the projected kernel $\Pi_{D_0}q$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

