$(d,q,p)$ be properly tight.  Then for any Borel $f(t, x)\geq0$   we have  
\begin{equation}

I(p,q,f):= E_{\cF_{\tau}}\int_{\tau}^{\gamma}e^{-\phi_{\tau,t}}\kappa_{t}
f(\sft_{t},x_{t})\,dA_{t}\leq N(d)  (A+B^{2})^{ d/(2p)}
