  \sum_{z_0\in\mathbb C_r} {\rm Res}_{{z}=z_0}\,({z}I_{a_\zeta}-A_\zeta)^{-1}
  (-B_-T^{-1/2}+B_+T^{1/2})S({z})=-B_-(T+T^{-1})^{1/2}
