    where $C$ is a constant determined by $s_0$ and $\gamma$

[Definition 33 (Good vertices) of arXiv:2604.25877, 'Asymptotic height of Plancherel random trees'] The set of \emph{good vertices} at depth $h$ is:
$$\mathcal G_h^{\mathrm{good}}
:=
