[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2605.30030, 'Critical exponents for planar random-cluster model with cluster-weight~$q=4$'] Fix~$k \ge 1$. For any~$\eps \geq \delta > 0$ and~$x,y \in \bbR^2$ with~$|x|/16 \geq |y| \geq 4\eps$,
\begin{align}
\widetilde\pi_{2k}^\delta(x,y,\eps) \asymp \pi_{2k}^\delta(|x|,|y|)^2\pi_1^\delta(\eps,|y|)^4.

\end{align}

