        H_i^0(x)\cap B_r(x)\cap B_\delta \big(A_{\sigma}\setminus B_r(x)\big)=H_i^{\epsilon}(x)\cap B_r(x)\cap B_\delta \big(A_{\sigma}\setminus B_r(x)\big),
