[Lemma 12 (\textsf{Quenched zero-temperature concentration}) of arXiv:2609.02064, 'Coalescence and fluctuations of O'Connell--Yor polymers\\ via the free-energy correlation '] Fix $n\in\Z_{>0}$, $\al\in\R$, and $z\in\R$.  Then, almost surely,
  \begin{align}
