[Lemma 24 of arXiv:2604.01978, 'Homogenized Transformers'] For $\mu$ as in Assumption \ref{ass:low-temperature},
\begin{equation*}
   \E\left\<\mathsf{m}_{\upbeta,\bA}[\mu](x),\mathsf{m}_{\upbeta,\bA}[\mu](y)\right\>=\E\left\<\frac{\bA x}{\|\bA x\|},\frac{\bA y}{\|\bA y\|}\right\>+O\left(d^{-\frac32}+\upbeta^{-\frac12}\right)
\end{equation*}
