[Thm 12 of arXiv:2609.03268, 'Poincare Polynomials of Heavy-Light Hassett Spaces'] The ordered $r$-Bell numbers $b(n,r)$ defined above satisfies the recurrence 
                $$b(n,r) = r^{n-1}+\sum_{i=1}^{n-1} {n\choose i} r^{i-1}b(n-i,r)$$
