[Lemma lem:boundary-terminal of arXiv:2412.01995, 'Exciting games and Monge-Amp\`{e}re equations'] For any $t,s \in [0,1)$, $x \in \Delta$, we have the equality
    \begin{align*}
        \frac{1}{1-s}v(s,x)-d \log (1-s)= \frac{1}{1-t} \,  v(t,x)-d \log(1-t).
    \end{align*}
Moreover, for any $(t^0,x^0) \in [0,1) \times \partial \Delta $, 
\[ \lim\limits_{(t,x)\to (t^0,x^0)} v(t,x)= +\infty.\]

