    Define $\mathcal K(h)=\{i:\eta_i' = h\}$. Let $\{a_i\}$ satisfy the condition in Lemma~(lem-Poisson-coupling of the paper). Under the coupling in Lemma~(lem-Poisson-coupling of the paper) we have
    \begin{align*}
        \pi\left( \#\left( \{i:\zeta_i' = \eta_i' \} \cap \mathcal K(h) \right) \geq \frac{ |\mathcal K(h)| (1+\mathbf{1}_{ \{ |\mathcal K(h)|< n^{1/6} \} }) }{2} \mbox{ for all } h \right) \geq 1 - \frac{1}{n^{1/8}} \,.
    \end{align*}

