[Prop expanding_critical_equations of arXiv:2506.12171, 'The multinomial dimer model'] Suppose $q$ is a $C^2$ function on $R$. For $u\in B\cap R_n$, we have the expansion
    \begin{align}
        \mathcal{C}_n(\exp(n  q(u)) = 1 - \mathcal{D}(q(u)) (1/n) + O(1/n^2)
    \end{align}
    as $1/n\to 0$.

