[Lemma 52 (Bounding lemma) of arXiv:2608.29157, 'Dilator-based analysis of $\KP$'] Let $A$ be a $\Sigma^{\ttL(u)_\ttOmega}$-formula and $H(\ttX)\vDash \alpha\le\beta<\ttOmega$.
    Then
    \begin{equation*}
        H[\ttX] \sststile{\rho}{\alpha} \Gamma, A \implies H[\ttX]\sststile{\rho}{\alpha} \Gamma, A^{\ttL(u)_\beta}.
    \end{equation*}

