[Lemma facnv1 of arXiv:2511.06321, 'Torus scaling limits and the plateau of the critical weakly coupled $|\varphi|^4$ model in'] Assume that, for each $q \in (\T^d)^*$,  $\lim_{N\rightarrow \infty} \widehat{Q}_N (L^{-N} q ) = \widehat{Q} (q)$ and $\sup_{N}\norm{\widehat{Q}_N}_{\ell^{\infty}} < \infty$.
Then
\begin{align}
	\lim_{N\rightarrow \infty} L^{dN} (f_N,  Q_N f_N) \rightarrow (f,Q f)	.
\end{align}

