[Proposition eq:conv_traces_one_hot of arXiv:2608.28169, 'characteristic polynomial of self-normalized random matrices'] Let $\ell \geqslant 1$ and $k_1, \dots, k_{\ell} \geqslant 1$. Then we have the convergence in 
    \begin{equation}

    \left(\operatorname{Tr} \left[ ({\mathbf Y}_n^{(0)})^{k_1} \right], \dots, \operatorname{Tr} \left[ ({\mathbf Y}_n^{(0)})^{k_\ell} \right] \right) \stackrel{\rm d}{\rightarrow} \left(Z_{k_1}^{(0)}, \dots, Z_{k_\ell}^{(0)} \right) \,, \qquad n\to\infty\,.
    \end{equation}

