  $\nu,\kappa\in\bN$ is equivalent to $\nu_{Z(\kappa)}=\kappa$ and
  implies $[\nu]=[\kappa]$. Let $\kappa=\partial\mu$ and
  $\nu=\partial\mu+\psi_{[\mu]}$ for any $\psi\in\bN$. Then
  $Z(\kappa)=Z(\partial\mu)=Z(\mu)$ and
